<modDesc descVersion="106">
    <author>CeberusOne</author>
    <version>0.3.2.0</version>
    <title>
        <en>FS25 Enhanced</en>
        <de>FS25 Enhanced</de>
    </title>
    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[Client-local adaptive graphics and performance governor for Farming Simulator 25.
Uses only documented Giants Engine / Settings APIs. No binary hooks.
v0.3.2.0: Gen-1 Settings GUI (Simple/Advanced/Expert/Status); ModSettings docking; Expert+Diagnostics status.
Auto-apply off until user Adaptive/Preset. Soft-Apply off. No EXPERIMENTAL engine setters from GUI.]]></en>
        <de><![CDATA[Client-lokaler adaptiver Grafik- und Performance-Governor für Landwirtschafts-Simulator 25.
Nutzt ausschließlich dokumentierte Giants-Engine-/Settings-APIs. Keine Binary-Hooks.
v0.3.2.0: Gen-1 Settings-GUI (Einfach/Erweitert/Expert/Status); ModSettings-Andockung; Expert+Diagnostics-Status.
Auto-Apply aus bis User Adaptive/Preset. Soft-Apply aus. Keine EXPERIMENTAL-Engine-Setter aus der GUI.]]></de>
    </description>
    <iconFilename>icon.png</iconFilename>
    <multiplayer supported="true"/>
    <l10n filenamePrefix="l10n/l10n">
        <text name="FS25E_MOD_NAME">
            <en>FS25 Enhanced</en>
            <de>FS25 Enhanced</de>
        </text>
    </l10n>
